<title>USA: U.S. mortgage application volume fell in latest wk.</title>
<headline>U.S. mortgage application volume fell in latest wk.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The volume of U.S. mortgage applications fell 7.4 percent in the week ended March 7, according to a Mortgage Bankers Association of America weekly survey.</p>
<p>Specifically, the volume of applications to refinance mortgages fell 13.5 percent in the latest survey week, while applications to purchase mortgages fell 5.1 percent.</p>
<p>The seasonally adjusted refinancing index fell 13.5 percent to 398.7 from 460.9 the previous week.</p>
<p>The purchase index fell 5.6 percent to 176.0 in the latest survey from 186.4 in the previous week.</p>
